#. Short description.
#, gp-priority: high
msgid "Membership register, volunteer hours and a fair membership fee: members who volunteer more pay less. Optional discount and Stripe payments."
msgstr "Medlemsregister, frivillige timer og et retfærdigt kontingent: medlemmer, der lægger flere frivillige timer, betaler mindre. Valgfri rabat og betalinger via Stripe."

#. Plugin name.
#, gp-priority: high
msgid "Fair Member Fees"
msgstr "Fair Member Fees"

#. Found in faq paragraph.
msgid "Nothing, unless you turn on \"Delete data\" in the settings."
msgstr "Intet, medmindre du slår \"Slet data\" til i indstillingerne."

#. Found in faq paragraph.
msgid "No. The server always calculates the fee from the saved block settings and the recorded hours."
msgstr "Nej. Serveren beregner altid kontingentet ud fra de gemte blokindstillinger og de registrerede timer."

#. Found in faq paragraph.
msgid "Only administrators and editors (the capability <code>famefe_manage</code>)."
msgstr "Kun administratorer og redaktører (rettigheden <code>famefe_manage</code>)."

#. Found in faq paragraph.
msgid "Every logged-in member records own hours. Administrators and editors can record hours for any member. In the settings you can allow logged-in non-members to record hours too; their hours count only in the totals."
msgstr "Hvert indlogget medlem registrerer selv sine timer. Administratorer og redaktører kan registrere timer for ethvert medlem. I indstillingerne kan du også tillade indloggede ikke-medlemmer at registrere timer; deres timer tæller kun med i totalerne."

#. Found in faq paragraph.
msgid "The button is off until you turn it on in the Membership fees block (\"Payment button\"). Turn it on once the volunteer hours of the period are closed and the fees are final; until then members see the fee calculated from the hours recorded so far. Online payment also needs the Stripe keys in the settings. If your club only keeps records of hours, simply leave the button off."
msgstr "Knappen er slået fra, indtil du slår den til i blokken Kontingenter (\"Betalingsknap\"). Slå den til, når periodens frivillige timer er lukket, og kontingenterne er endelige; indtil da ser medlemmerne kontingentet beregnet ud fra de timer, der er registreret indtil nu. Onlinebetaling kræver også Stripe-nøglerne i indstillingerne. Hvis din klub kun fører regnskab med timer, så lad bare knappen være slået fra."

#. Found in faq header.
msgid "What happens with the data when I delete the plugin?"
msgstr "Hvad sker der med dataene, når jeg sletter pluginet?"

#. Found in faq header.
msgid "Can the amount to pay be changed in the browser?"
msgstr "Kan beløbet, der skal betales, ændres i browseren?"

#. Found in faq header.
msgid "Who sees the form for cash payments?"
msgstr "Hvem ser formularen til kontante betalinger?"

#. Found in faq header.
msgid "Who can record hours?"
msgstr "Hvem kan registrere timer?"

#. Found in faq header.
msgid "Why do members not see the payment button?"
msgstr "Hvorfor ser medlemmerne ikke betalingsknappen?"

#. Found in installation list item.
msgid "Add the blocks to your pages (search for \"Fair Member Fees\" in the block inserter). Set the period, the base fee and the discount in the Membership fees block."
msgstr "Tilføj blokkene til dine sider (søg efter \"Fair Member Fees\" i blokindsætteren). Angiv perioden, grundkontingentet og rabatten i blokken Kontingenter."

#. Found in installation list item.
msgid "In <strong>Member Fees → Settings</strong> set the currency and, for online payments, your Stripe keys and the webhook."
msgstr "Under <strong>Kontingenter → Indstillinger</strong> angiver du valutaen og, til onlinebetalinger, dine Stripe-nøgler og webhooken."

#. Found in installation list item.
msgid "Go to <strong>Member Fees → Members</strong> and add your members; link them to their user accounts so that they can record hours and pay online."
msgstr "Gå til <strong>Kontingenter → Medlemmer</strong>, og tilføj dine medlemmer; knyt dem til deres brugerkonti, så de kan registrere timer og betale online."

#. Found in installation list item.
msgid "Install and activate the plugin."
msgstr "Installer og aktiver pluginet."

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "The editor scripts in <code>build/</code> are compiled from the human-readable sources in <code>src/</code> (included in the plugin) with <code>@wordpress/scripts</code> (<code>npm install</code>, <code>npm run build</code>). The development repository is public: https://github.com/globus2008/fair-member-fees"
msgstr "Editorscriptsene i <code>build/</code> er kompileret fra de læsbare kilder i <code>src/</code> (inkluderet i pluginet) med <code>@wordpress/scripts</code> (<code>npm install</code>, <code>npm run build</code>). Udviklingsrepositoriet er offentligt: https://github.com/globus2008/fair-member-fees"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "Stripe terms of service: https://stripe.com/legal/ssa – Stripe privacy policy: https://stripe.com/privacy"
msgstr "Stripes servicevilkår: https://stripe.com/legal/ssa – Stripes privatlivspolitik: https://stripe.com/privacy"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "This plugin connects to <strong>Stripe</strong> (https://stripe.com) to let members pay their membership fee by card. It is used only when you enter a Stripe secret key in the plugin settings."
msgstr "Dette plugin forbinder til <strong>Stripe</strong> (https://stripe.com), så medlemmer kan betale deres kontingent med kort. Det bruges kun, når du indtaster en hemmelig nøgle til Stripe i pluginets indstillinger."

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "Instead of the percentage, you can set the total to collect: the discount of the same members is then calculated so that all regular members pay exactly this amount together (for example to give back what the double fees of members without hours brought above the expected total)."
msgstr "I stedet for procentsatsen kan du angive det samlede beløb at opkræve: rabatten til de samme medlemmer beregnes så, at alle almindelige medlemmer tilsammen betaler præcis dette beløb (for eksempel for at give tilbage, hvad de dobbelte kontingenter fra medlemmer uden timer har indbragt ud over den forventede total)."

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "Set a share of members (e.g. 60 %) and a discount (e.g. 20 %) in the Membership fees block: the given share of regular members with the lowest fees pays the given percentage less. Members with the same fee as the last of them get it too; members without hours never get it. The discount is not added to the fees of the others."
msgstr "Angiv en andel af medlemmerne (f.eks. 60 %) og en rabat (f.eks. 20 %) i blokken Kontingenter: den angivne andel af almindelige medlemmer med de laveste kontingenter betaler den angivne procentsats mindre. Medlemmer med samme kontingent som den sidste af dem får den også; medlemmer uden timer får den aldrig. Rabatten lægges ikke oven i de andres kontingenter."

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "<strong>Discount (optional)</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>Rabat (valgfri)</strong>"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "Whoever does not volunteer pays twice the base fee, so paying instead of working is never the cheaper choice. Hours of honorary members and non-members are shown in the totals but do not change the fees."
msgstr "Den, der ikke lægger frivillige timer, betaler det dobbelte grundkontingent, så det aldrig er billigst at betale i stedet for at arbejde. Timer fra æresmedlemmer og ikke-medlemmer vises i totalerne, men ændrer ikke kontingenterne."

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "<strong>How the fee is calculated</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>Sådan beregnes kontingentet</strong>"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "<strong>Features</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>Funktioner</strong>"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "Clubs live from the work of their members. Fair Member Fees rewards it: every member records the hours they volunteered, and the membership fee of each member is calculated from them. Whoever works for the club pays less; whoever does not, pays twice the base fee – paying instead of working is never the cheaper choice."
msgstr "Klubber lever af deres medlemmers arbejde. Fair Member Fees belønner det: hvert medlem registrerer de frivillige timer, det har lagt, og ud fra dem beregnes hvert medlems kontingent. Den, der arbejder for klubben, betaler mindre; den, der ikke gør, betaler det dobbelte grundkontingent – at betale i stedet for at arbejde er aldrig det billigste valg."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "When the member returns, the plugin asks Stripe whether the payment was completed. Stripe also sends the result to the webhook address of the plugin."
msgstr "Når medlemmet vender tilbage, spørger pluginet Stripe, om betalingen blev gennemført. Stripe sender også resultatet til pluginets webhook-adresse."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "When a member clicks the payment button, the plugin sends to Stripe: the amount and currency, the name of the payment (\"Membership fee\" and the period), the member's e-mail address, the member ID and the period, and the addresses of your page to return to. The member then enters the card details directly on the Stripe payment page."
msgstr "Når et medlem klikker på betalingsknappen, sender pluginet til Stripe: beløbet og valutaen, betalingens navn (\"Kontingent\" og perioden), medlemmets e-mailadresse, medlems-ID og perioden samt adresserne på din side, der skal vendes tilbage til. Medlemmet indtaster derefter kortoplysningerne direkte på Stripes betalingsside."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "A member without any recorded hours in the period always pays twice the base fee."
msgstr "Et medlem uden registrerede timer i perioden betaler altid det dobbelte grundkontingent."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "The unreduced fees add up to more than the expected total; the difference is taken off every fee equally. No fee goes below zero (the rest is shared by the others)."
msgstr "De ureducerede kontingenter giver tilsammen mere end den forventede total; forskellen trækkes ligeligt fra hvert kontingent. Intet kontingent kommer under nul (resten deles af de andre)."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Unreduced fee = expected total × (1 − share of hours)."
msgstr "Ureduceret kontingent = forventet total × (1 − andel af timer)."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Share of hours = hours of the member / hours of all regular members."
msgstr "Andel af timer = medlemmets timer / alle almindelige medlemmers timer."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Expected total = base fee × number of regular members."
msgstr "Forventet total = grundkontingent × antal almindelige medlemmer."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Ready for translation."
msgstr "Klar til oversættelse."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "<strong>Fee calculation explained</strong> – the method on an example with your own numbers."
msgstr "<strong>Kontingentberegning forklaret</strong> – metoden med et eksempel med dine egne tal."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "<strong>Members list</strong>,"
msgstr "<strong>Medlemsliste</strong>,"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "<strong>Volunteer hours list</strong>,"
msgstr "<strong>Liste over frivillige timer</strong>,"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "<strong>Volunteer hours form</strong>,"
msgstr "<strong>Formular til frivillige timer</strong>,"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "<strong>Membership fees</strong> – the fee table of a period; its payment button is turned on once the hours of the period are closed,"
msgstr "<strong>Kontingenter</strong> – kontingenttabellen for en periode; dens betalingsknap slås til, når periodens timer er lukket,"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Five blocks, all set up in the block settings – no shortcodes:"
msgstr "Fem blokke, alle sat op i blokindstillingerne – ingen kortkoder:"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Online payment of the fee through Stripe Checkout; cash and bank payments recorded by administrators and editors."
msgstr "Onlinebetaling af kontingentet via Stripe Checkout; kontante betalinger og bankoverførsler registreres af administratorer og redaktører."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Optional discount for the members with the lowest fees."
msgstr "Valgfri rabat til medlemmerne med de laveste kontingenter."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Fair calculation of the fees for any period (season), see below."
msgstr "Retfærdig beregning af kontingenterne for enhver periode (sæson), se nedenfor."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Volunteer hours recorded by the members themselves, or by administrators and editors for anybody."
msgstr "Frivillige timer registreret af medlemmerne selv eller af administratorer og redaktører for hvem som helst."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Full history of every member: joined, membership type changed, membership ended, rejoined – each with the date of the change, who recorded it and when."
msgstr "Fuld historik for hvert medlem: indmeldt, medlemstype ændret, medlemskab ophørt, genindmeldt – hver gang med datoen for ændringen, hvem der registrerede den, og hvornår."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Membership register with regular and honorary members (honorary members pay no fee)."
msgstr "Medlemsregister med almindelige medlemmer og æresmedlemmer (æresmedlemmer betaler ikke kontingent)."

#. Found in description header.
msgid "Source code"
msgstr "Kildekode"

#. Found in description header.
msgid "External services"
msgstr "Eksterne tjenester"

#. Screenshot description.
msgid "Member Fees → Settings: currency and Stripe keys for online payments."
msgstr "Kontingenter → Indstillinger: valuta og Stripe-nøgler til onlinebetalinger."

#. Screenshot description.
msgid "Member Fees → Volunteer hours: all recorded hours with filters."
msgstr "Kontingenter → Frivillige timer: alle registrerede timer med filtre."

#. Screenshot description.
msgid "Every change of a membership is kept in the history with the date of the change, who recorded it and when."
msgstr "Hver ændring af et medlemskab gemmes i historikken med datoen for ændringen, hvem der registrerede den, og hvornår."

#. Screenshot description.
msgid "Member Fees → Members: the membership register."
msgstr "Kontingenter → Medlemmer: medlemsregistret."

#. Screenshot description.
msgid "All options of the blocks are in the block settings: the period, the base fee, the discount, the payment button, columns, names and table colours."
msgstr "Alle blokkenes indstillinger findes i blokindstillingerne: perioden, grundkontingentet, rabatten, betalingsknappen, kolonner, navne og tabelfarver."

#. Screenshot description.
msgid "The Fee calculation explained block shows the method on an example with your own base fee and discount."
msgstr "Blokken Kontingentberegning forklaret viser metoden med et eksempel med dit eget grundkontingent og din egen rabat."

#. Screenshot description.
msgid "The Volunteer hours form and list: members record their own hours, administrators and editors record them for anybody."
msgstr "Formularen og listen over frivillige timer: medlemmerne registrerer selv deres timer, administratorer og redaktører registrerer dem for hvem som helst."

#. Screenshot description.
msgid "The Members list block with the totals of regular and honorary members."
msgstr "Blokken Medlemsliste med totalerne for almindelige medlemmer og æresmedlemmer."

#. Screenshot description.
msgid "The Membership fees block: the fee of every member calculated from the volunteer hours, with the optional discount and the totals rows."
msgstr "Blokken Kontingenter: hvert medlems kontingent beregnet ud fra de frivillige timer, med den valgfri rabat og totalrækkerne."

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "First release."
msgstr "Første udgivelse."
